# "This creature can't block." Bot2's Memnite attacks on turn 4. Bot1 may not block with Mudbutton Cursetosser (refused), while its
# Ornithopter, in the same combat, can (the positive control): the Memnite is blocked and Bot1 takes no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mudbutton Cursetosser
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: B)
Bot1.Hand.Mudbutton Cursetosser.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Mudbutton Cursetosser > Memnite)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Memnite)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mudbutton Cursetosser; Ornithopter
